@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@targetQps = 1000
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@activityScopeKey = replace-with-activity-scope-key

### 0. 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 1. 健康检查
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### 2. Micrometer 指标列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics

### 3. 正式订单创建 Counter
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/order.created.count

### 4. 运维摘要
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/metrics-summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. 当前订单流水线容量结构评估
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/capacity/order-pipeline
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 按目标 Submit QPS 生成容量压力计划
### 这是配置结构评估，不等于真实 Benchmark 结果。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/capacity/order-pipeline/pressure-plan?targetQps={{targetQps}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. 预热订单提交元数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/metadata-prewarm/order-submit
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Waiting Room 批量放行
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/waiting-room/admission-batches?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}&count=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9. 临时关闭指定 activity scope 的订单提交
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/degrade/order-submit?activityScopeKey={{activityScopeKey}}&ttlSeconds=300
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. 恢复指定 activity scope
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/degrade/order-submit?activityScopeKey={{activityScopeKey}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
